ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6I6J6NOmtVYQ7kNvwGZxwyu&_nc_oc=AdoYi0t92ZILOTkb3K1vjRWUpqRLXN3A92Sd1lYJxZQa0x8VLCX5PgqOOESXTgAg1Sk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6VFzSVondOq3svQsbLc0DHQ38CYBO9SriW523IToJFAw&oe=6A0B14B9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0FH2qHElkm8Q7kNvwGkCeoS&_nc_oc=AdoN4bRv_5weABdv_jpmFcZ0mMg2ZdtUtZeiijzxj2nksLSFy-IbvOKGn134x26eh38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Av5rus7P51gBOtARaQgi5fx9dy5sROy6ga36tGgEiSA&oe=6A0B030F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=grXmUroRHIIQ7kNvwGZEZVd&_nc_oc=AdoGrpQeGLhDm2HkF45KJ2EjDiI64XSMaIIupVsYcFC4ZPN_EQtuC3JR1nbJRahnIE4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4rXDT3Er55Edj7p5tKy5qsRnQZQkH773hOdKKGO3YbHg&oe=6A0B10EE"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa